{
  "source": "Prompts/how-ai-answers-2.mp4",
  "duration": 191.4253125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.8,
      "text": "When you ask an AI a question, like, what should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.26,
      "end": 6.76,
      "text": "It first works out what your words mean together."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.2,
      "end": 8.68,
      "text": "But then it faces a new problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.26,
      "end": 11.22,
      "text": "How does it actually begin an answer?"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.98,
      "end": 15.78,
      "text": "To make this easy to follow, let's treat whole words as single tokens."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.54,
      "end": 20.62,
      "text": "This diagram shows the four steps your question goes through before the answer begins."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.26,
      "end": 26.5,
      "text": "The AI breaks the question into tokens, marks their positions, turns them into starting"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.5,
      "end": 29.46,
      "text": "vectors, and passes those numbers through its layers."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.64,
      "end": 35.74,
      "text": "Here each token's vector updates using information from previous tokens to reflect the sequence."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.72,
      "end": 38.7,
      "text": "Here we see the comparison side by side."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.24,
      "end": 41.88,
      "text": "Look at the question mark in, what should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.56,
      "end": 46.34,
      "text": "After passing through the layers, its numbers reflect naming a dog."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.94,
      "end": 51.82,
      "text": "But the exact same question mark token in, what should I cook for dinner, updates to"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.82,
      "end": 52.94,
      "text": "reflect choosing a meal."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.72,
      "end": 59.02,
      "text": "By the time the prompt finishes processing, the updated mathematical vector of that final"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.02,
      "end": 63.08,
      "text": "question mark contains the highly specific context of your entire request."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.06,
      "end": 68.56,
      "text": "AI uses the final token's updated vector to predict the first token of its answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.38,
      "end": 73.34,
      "text": "This interface shows the initial probability distribution for the very first word."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.02,
      "end": 81.16,
      "text": "The AI hasn't written anything yet, but predicts you at 18%, a at 14%, and great"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.16,
      "end": 82.2,
      "text": "at 9%."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.2,
      "end": 88.04,
      "text": "Notice the bottom line, the remaining 59% is spread across thousands of other possible"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.04,
      "end": 88.8,
      "text": "starting tokens."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.68,
      "end": 94.92,
      "text": "In this instance, the AI selects you from the top of the list and adds it to the empty"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.92,
      "end": 95.66,
      "text": "reply space."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.54,
      "end": 97.92,
      "text": "You is now the last token."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.72,
      "end": 101.9,
      "text": "Its updated vector reflects your question and the reply so far."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.68,
      "end": 107.94,
      "text": "The AI doesn't draft a whole sentence in its head, it only ever calculates one single"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.94,
      "end": 112.62,
      "text": "step ahead, using the exact mathematical state of that new final token."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.4,
      "end": 115.12,
      "text": "This creates a generation loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.06,
      "end": 122.38,
      "text": "Using you as the anchor, the AI calculates and adds could, then calculates and adds name,"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.92,
      "end": 124.82,
      "text": "and then him, one by one."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.78,
      "end": 128.14,
      "text": "Each added token becomes part of the context."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.82,
      "end": 133.18,
      "text": "As the sentence grows longer and clearer, the AI's predictions narrow down and become"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.18,
      "end": 134.12,
      "text": "much more specific."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.74,
      "end": 139.68,
      "text": "The output of one step immediately feeds right back in as the critical input for the next,"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.02,
      "end": 142.14,
      "text": "forming a continuous mathematical loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.08,
      "end": 144.4,
      "text": "Look at this probability chart."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.32,
      "end": 150.04,
      "text": "Our context is now, you could name him, which makes a dog name the mathematically"
    },
    {
      "start": 150.04,
      "end": 151.34,
      "text": "likeliest next token."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.08,
      "end": 159.48,
      "text": "The top predictions are spot at 22%, max at 17%, and buddy at 14%, with other tokens"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.48,
      "end": 161.64,
      "text": "making up the remaining 47%."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.64,
      "end": 163.58,
      "text": "The AI selects spot for this run."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.42,
      "end": 169.42,
      "text": "But because this relies on probability, if you ran the exact same prompt again, it might"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.42,
      "end": 170.88,
      "text": "select a completely different name."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.74,
      "end": 176.56,
      "text": "After spot, the AI treats punctuation as its own predicted token and adds a period."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.18,
      "end": 181.16,
      "text": "A special end-of-answer token signals that the reply is complete."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.22,
      "end": 185.22,
      "text": "Every answer is built one token at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.74,
      "end": 187.6,
      "text": "The whole run is called inference."
    }
  ],
